{
  "version": "1.1",
  "notes": "# 1.1\n- **CUSTOM CODE mode** — new button in the header. Turn it ON and build your own server: write features in `resources/core` (server/client/UI) — updates will never overwrite your code. Majestic platform files (server binaries, modules) keep updating as usual. Turning it OFF returns full updates and replaces changed code with the released version.\n\n# 1.0\n- First release — welcome!\n- **In-game dev HUD**: chat with command suggestions (`/` + **Tab**, arrow-up history, Russian layout recognized), red alert for unknown/failed commands, M menu, clothes debug board, makeup studio with a fully frozen ped, noclip, photo mode, prop attach, draggable and scalable interface, Roboto Mono everywhere\n- **Server Manager**: drag & drop DLC packs (rename / disable / delete), facial_overlays.meta upload and delete, server start/stop with colored log\n- **Updates**: when a new version is out the header blinks green **UPDATE** — click it, read the notes, press **UPDATE NOW**. Server binaries update remotely too, no reinstall\n- **Installer**: one file, pick a folder — everything downloads from GitHub\n",
